<title>USA: State Street Research names Asia portfolio manager.</title>
<headline>State Street Research names Asia portfolio manager.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Research and Management on Wednesday named Virginie Maisonneuve as international portfolio manager, specializing on Asia.</p>
<p>Maisonneuve joins State Street Research from Batterymarch Financial Management .</p>
<p>Boston-based State Street Research managed as of June 30 $44 billion in assets, including $31 billion for institutional clients.</p>
<p>((Michael Ellis, (617) 367-4106))</p>
